WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.860 --> 00:00:05.470 align:start position:0%
 
everybody  a rare sight for these voters in Rio de  Janeiro a presidential candidate  campaigning in a place dominated by drug  traffickers and violence  just four months ago 20 people were  killed during a police raid here in the  complex a sprawling brick and cement  network of favelas or slums leftist  former leader luisi nasu Lula da Silva  promised that their lives would change  as they had during his last presidential  term  I doubt that you will find any  construction from incumbent president  Yaya bolsonaro here or in any Favela in  the state  but even people who benefited from  social projects during Lula's presidency  more than 10 years ago and moved from  Shacks to these government-built  departments are divided  we don't believe in promises president  bosnare has promised nothing but has  given emergency aid to face the pandemic  and the consequences of the war in  Ukraine  I voted for bolsonaro in 2018 because  the economy was in the dumps I changed  my vote to Lula after I survived a heart  attack this year thanks to the public  hospital he built next to my house  remembers how life changed after the  police pacified the Favela bula's  government built a huge cable car system  transforming the complex into an  international attraction  voters here are looking back at more  prosperous times when money was being  invested in these communities ahead of  the 2016 Olympic Games 50 000 tourists  used to come to this Favela every week  and they would buy arts and crafts and  little stores here they would go to  parties there were bars there were  restaurants there were even hotels to  stay overnight now all of that is long  gone familiar people felt abandoned the  money dried out violence is back  corruption scandals made many lose faith  and politicians to the point that they  voted for bolsonaro who says he'll fight  violence with more violence instead of  investing in education lauriana Souza  was one of the disillusion she had  opened a bar to cater to tourists but  was forced to shut it down  official they closed the cable car from  one day to the next nobody comes here  anymore  she says she'll vote for Lula she hopes  he'll fix the cable car and transform  the slums once again  Rio de Janeiro

